Note on pyswisseph:
scripts/astro_profile.py optionally uses pyswisseph, which wraps the Swiss
Ephemeris library (https://www.astro.com/swisseph/). Swiss Ephemeris is
licensed under AGPL or a commercial license. pyswisseph is NOT included in
this repository and must be installed separately. Confirm the appropriate
license before using the astrology features in a commercial or hosted product.
